# AWS Highly Available Web Application Infrastructure

## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates the design and deployment of a **highly available static web application infrastructure on AWS using Terraform**.

The application is deployed on Amazon EC2 instances running in **private subnets across multiple Availability Zones**. An **Application Load Balancer (ALB)** distributes incoming HTTP traffic across the EC2 instances, while an **Auto Scaling Group (ASG)** maintains application availability and automatically replaces unhealthy instances.

The entire AWS infrastructure is provisioned and managed using **Terraform Infrastructure as Code (IaC)**.


---

## 🏗️ Architecture

```text
                         INTERNET
                            │
                            ▼
                 ┌─────────────────────┐
                 │ Application Load    │
                 │ Balancer (ALB)      │
                 │      Port 80        │
                 └──────────┬──────────┘
                            │
              ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐
              │                           │
              ▼                           ▼
      ┌────────────────┐         ┌────────────────┐
      │ Private Subnet │         │ Private Subnet │
      │     AZ-1       │         │     AZ-2       │
      │                │         │                │
      │  EC2 + Nginx   │         │  EC2 + Nginx   │
      │  Web Server    │         │  Web Server    │
      └───────┬────────┘         └────────┬───────┘
              │                           │
              ▼                           ▼
        NAT Gateway                NAT Gateway
              │                           │
              └─────────────┬─────────────┘
                            │
                            ▼
                       Internet
```
![vpc-image](vpc.png)
![alb-image](alb.png) 
![igw-image](igw.png) 
![subnet-image](subnets.png)
---

## 🚀 Application

A static web template from **Tooplate – Orbital** is deployed on the EC2 instances.

The template is automatically downloaded and configured during EC2 instance initialization using Terraform `user_data`.

The web application is served using **Nginx** and accessed through the Application Load Balancer DNS endpoint.

![website-image](website.png)
