## ✨ Key Features

* Highly available multi-AZ architecture
* Public and private subnet separation
* Internet-facing Application Load Balancer
* EC2 instances deployed in private subnets
* Auto Scaling Group with minimum, desired, and maximum capacity
* CPU-based Auto Scaling policy
* ALB health checks
* Automatic replacement of unhealthy instances
* NAT Gateway for private subnet internet access
* Security Group based traffic control
* Automated Nginx installation
* Automated static website deployment
* Infrastructure fully provisioned using Terraform
* AWS Systems Manager access without requiring an EC2 key pair

